abstract: "TMI-Lean Formal Library (TLFL) is an independent Lean 4 library for core TMI definitions, event structures, bridge surfaces, interface mathematics, OLean kernel-checking boundaries, and guarded proof-status passports. The v0.5.1-alpha release adds a separate experimental interface-foundations module for two-sided interfaces, PlanckTouch and HorizonTouch boundary records, third-body criteria, memory, energy, two-axis time relations, and predictive gates. This alpha status does not claim empirical physics validation or stable API closure."
